    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lia̱a̱ Muthɛ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Muthɛ jiɛɛn paan Mo-ab wee wi̱i̱ Pa̱a̱m Nɛbo, ni biikä Pa̱a̱m Pi̱dh-ga, min lot ni Jɛ-ri-ko. Kä cu Kuoth Nhial ɛ nyuɔ̱th muɔ̱n diaal, nikä Gil-yad a räth ni kä Daan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nap-ta-li kɛɛliw ni këth Ɛ-pa-rim kɛnɛ Ma-na-thɛ, mun Juda kɛɛliw bapɛ jɛ ni kui̱ konyä ca̱ŋ Bar in Bo̱r in te kam wi̱i̱ni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A lɛnɛ ka̱n ni kä Nɛ-gɛb a wä kueer min mɔ lööl Jɛ-ri-ko wec thɔa̱a̱ri, a räth ni kä Dho-ar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial Muthɛ jiök i̱, “Nɛmɛ ɛ jɛn mun ëë cä ya̱c A-bɛ-ram kɛnɛ Ay-dhɛk, kɛ Je-kɔb, ‘Bä ka̱m karku.’ Bä ji̱ jak kä nɛ̈ɛ̈ni jɛ kɛ waŋdu, duundɛ ɣöö ci bi cop thi̱n.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn cu Muthɛ kuany Kuɔth Nhial cu li̱w ɛn wi̱i̱ni muun Mo-ab, nikɛ ruac Kuɔth Nhial, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä cu Kuoth Nhial jɛ kony rɛy lo̱o̱lä muun Mo-ab lotdä Beth-pɛ-yor. Kä thilɛ ram mi ŋäc gua̱a̱th in ca kony thi̱n mäni walɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Muthɛ li̱w a tëë kɛ run ti kuɔr wi̱cdɛ jiɛɛn da̱ŋ rɛw /kenɛ cɔr kä ŋuɔ̱t buɔ̱mdɛ ni thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal Muthɛ par rɛy paan Mo-ab kɛ ni̱n ti jiɛɛn diɔ̱k. Kä mëë ci ni̱n pärä Muthɛ thuɔ̱k.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Jɔ-cua gat Nun thia̱a̱ŋ kɛ yiëë ŋäcä kɛ ɣöö, ci Muthɛ jɛ poth. Cua jɛ luɔ̱th ɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal, kä cukɛ jɛ la̱t ce̱tnikɛ mëë ci Kuoth Nhial ɛ la̱t Muthɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ thil gök mi cu rɔ jiɛc rɛy ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl mi ce̱tkɛ Muthɛ, min ŋäc Kuoth Nhial ni puɔ̱nydɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ thil ram mi cäät kɛ jɛ kɛ nyuuthni diaal kɛnɛ tin ga̱ykɛ naath tëë ci Kuoth Nhial kɛ jäk ni jɛ i̱ bɛ wä la̱t muun I-jëp, ti bɛ lät kä Pɛro kɛnɛ la̱a̱tkɛ kɛ wecdɛ kɛɛliw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ thil ram mi cäät kɛ jɛ kɛ bum diaal kɛnɛ bɛ̈c bɛ̈ɛ̈c tëë cɛ la̱t waaŋ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
